usage-groq-setting-api-key = 来自 https://console.groq.com/keys 的 GroqCloud Enterprise API 密钥。只有 Enterprise 组织才能读取 Prometheus 指标。
usage-groq-setting-base-url = 可选，用于私有网关的 HTTPS API 基础 URL。默认为 https://api.groq.com/v1。

usage-groq-prometheus = Prometheus 指标
usage-groq-last-5-minutes = 最近 5 分钟
usage-groq-requests = 请求数/分钟
usage-groq-tokens = Token/分钟
usage-groq-cache-hits = 缓存命中/分钟
usage-groq-metrics = 指标
usage-groq-unavailable = 不可用
usage-groq-enterprise-only = Prometheus 指标需要 GroqCloud Enterprise 密钥
